leeve's underlying return, then the resulting fee is scaled back by the\npa_core/fees.py:20:* **Management fee** (``mgmt_fee_bps``) is an annual rate in basis points,\npa_core/fees.py:21:  accrued linearly as a constant monthly drag ``mgmt_fee_bps / 1e4 / 12``.\npa_core/fees.py:22:* **Performance fee** (``perf_fee_pct``) is a fraction of the monthly return\npa_core/fees.py:23:  above an annual ``hurdle_bps`` hurdle (e.g. ``0.20`` for a 20% fee). It is\npa_core/fees.py:24:  crystallised monthly with no high-water mark and no rebate below the hurdle\npa_core/fees.py:25:  (negative excess is zero-clipped). A high-water-mark / notional-exact variant\npa_core/fees.py:28:All fee parameters are non-negative; an all-zero schedule is a no-op.\npa_core/fees.py:40:__all__ = [\"FeeSchedule\", \"compute_fee_drag\", \"apply_fees\"]\npa_core/fees.py:46:class FeeSchedule(BaseModel):\npa_core/fees.py:47:    \"\"\"Management + performance fee schedule for a single sleeve.\"\"\"\npa_core/fees.py:49:    model_config = ConfigDict(frozen=True)\npa_core/fees.py:51:    mgmt_fee_bps: float = Field(\npa_core/fees.py:54:        description=\"Annual management fee in basis points on notional.\",\npa_core/fees.py:56:    perf_fee_pct: float = Field(\npa_core/fees.py:60:        description=\"Performance fee as a fraction of return above the hurdle (e.g. 0.20).\",\npa_core/fees.py:65:        description=\"Annual performance-fee hurdle in basis points.\",\npa_core/fees.py:71:        return self.mgmt_fee_bps == 0.0 and self.perf_fee_pct == 0.0\npa_core/fees.py:74:def compute_fee_drag(\npa_core/fees.py:76:    schedule: FeeSchedule,\npa_core/fees.py:80:    \"\"\"Return the per-month fee drag matrix for ``gross`` contribution returns.\npa_core/fees.py:83:    (fees never increase returns). ``net = gross - compute_fee_drag(gross, ...)``.\npa_core/fees.py:91:    underlying_gross = gross_array / notional_share\npa_core/fees.py:92:    mgmt_monthly = schedule.mgmt_fee_bps / _BPS_PER_UNIT / _MONTHS_PER_YEAR\npa_core/fees.py:93:    drag = cast(ArrayLike, np.full_like(gross, mgmt_monthly))\npa_core/fees.py:94:    if schedule.perf_fee_pct > 0.0:\npa_core/fees.py:95:        hurdle_monthly = schedule.hurdle_bps / _BPS_PER_UNIT / _MONTHS_PER_YEAR\npa_core/fees.py:96:        excess = np.maximum(underlying_gross - hurdle_monthly, 0.0)\npa_core/fees.py:97:        drag = drag + schedule.perf_fee_pct * excess\npa_core/fees.py:101:def apply_fees(\npa_core/fees.py:103:    schedule: FeeSchedule,\npa_core/fees.py:107:    \"\"\"Return ``gross`` net of the management + performance fees in ``schedule``.\"\"\"\npa_core/fees.py:110:    return gross - compute_fee_drag(gross, schedule, notional_share=notional_share)\npa_core/facade.py:8:- Type-safe configuration with clear interfaces\npa_core/facade.py:13:    from pa_core.config import load_config\npa_core/facade.py:16:    config = load_config(\"config.yml\")\npa_core/facade.py:20:    artifacts = run_single(config, index_series, RunOptions(seed=42))\npa_core/facade.py:39:    from .config import ModelConfig\npa_core/facade.py:54:    if isinstance(value, float) and not math.isfinite(value):\npa_core/facade.py:152:        config: The resolved configuration used for the simulation.\npa_core/facade.py:163:    config: \"ModelConfig\"\npa_core/facade.py:179:        config: The resolved configuration used for the sweep.\npa_core/facade.py:187:    config: \"ModelConfig\"\npa_core/facade.py:200:        seed: Random seed for reproducible simulations. If None, uses non-deterministic RNG.\npa_core/facade.py:202:        config_overrides: Dictionary of config parameter overrides to apply.\npa_core/facade.py:203:        legacy_agent_rng: Use order-dependent agent RNG streams for backward compatibility.\npa_core/facade.py:208:        vol_regime: Volatility regime selection override.\npa_core/facade.py:209:        vol_regime_window: Window length for two-state volatility regime.\npa_core/facade.py:213:    seed: int | None = None\npa_core/facade.py:215:    con